  "description": "Ring B file-based integration rails for the Goldpath enterprise asset: rails declared as data with baked, compile-checked closures — file-level contracts, idempotent (file, line) ingestion, per-row quarantine that never stops the batch, zero-duplicate replay/reprocess, and archive marks — with the lifecycle published as integration events. The rail is the unit, not the pieces.",
